     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">With »pilot 4.0«, you can fix all the steps that »roboSet 2« should execute for upcoming orders. Even when it comes to automation, the software impresses with its intuitive operation, clear menus, large buttons, and a customizable surface. You’ll be able to quickly plan and start tool inspections and make data documentation simple.</p>",
