      "spots": [
       {
        "x": 14.779,
        "y": 23.286,
        "label": "status display",
        "text": "<h3>status display</h3> <p>The status display, shown as a percentage, displays how much of the current pallet has already been processed. This information can also be used to calculate when the tools on the pallet will be fully measured and ready for the operator to remove.</p>"
       },
       {
        "x": 74.618,
        "y": 35.286,
        "label": "Pallet management",
        "text": "<h3>Pallet management</h3> <p>The ZOLLER pallet management system manages the tooling configuration and parameters. This allows all tools to be measured without any additional user input, and customer-specific pallets to be defined. In addition, in the Pallet management area, tools are categorized and labeled with different colors if, for example, a tool lies outside the tolerance range.</p>"
       }
      ],
